        "typescript"
      ],
      "summary": "My experience contributing to capsule-render and bmates-ui.",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "### Contributing to the Community\n\nThere's nothing quite like the feeling of seeing the green `Merged` badge on an open-source pull request.\n\nRecently, I had PRs merged in:\n1. **capsule-render**: Working with SVG rendering and dynamic GitHub headers.\n2. **bmates-ui**: Fixing component export types in TypeScript.\n\nOpen source teaches you how to read other people's codebases, communicate concisely in PR discussions, and respect established linting and testing suites."
    }
